Package: devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-modesetting-asyncflip
Version: 1.0-2
Section: x11
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-modesetting
Recommends: xlibre
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Async flips on secondary outputs for the modesetting driver
 X11 OutputClass section that enables AsyncFlipSecondaries in the
 modesetting driver of XLibre (default: off). With DRI3 page flipping on
 a multi-display screen only one display is synchronized to vblank;
 with this option the other displays flip asynchronously and may tear.
 Mainly useful when the displays mirror or clone each other.
